	ISZ INDEX0
	JMP .-7		/LOOP

	JMS PRNT	/PRINT IT
CINSRT,	TAD TEMP1
	DCA I IXR	/STORE THE CHARACTER
	TAD IXR
	TAD (-LINBUF-100
	SZA CLA
	JMP CHLOOP	/GET ANOTHER CHARACTER
	JMS CRCR
	JMP I (SYNTAX	/ERROR

CARRET,	JMS CRCR
